IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-core`
IMPORT `ei6-part-9-coming-into-force`

-- Tests of section 190 (src:3171-3199). Expected values are read from the text by hand.

§ `Section 190 - the days on which provisions come into force`

#ASSERT `s 190(1) the day this Act comes into force` EQUALS YearMonthDay 1996 6 30
#ASSERT `s 190(2) the day on which the provisions listed in subsection (2) come into force` EQUALS YearMonthDay 1997 1 1
#ASSERT `s 190(3) the day on which the provisions listed in subsection (3) come into force` EQUALS YearMonthDay 1997 1 5
#ASSERT `s 190(6) the day on which sections 172 to 175 come into force` EQUALS YearMonthDay 1998 1 1
-- Section 4 and section 95 are in subsection (2) (src:3173): January 1, 1997.
#ASSERT `s 190 the day on which the provision comes into force` "section 4" EQUALS YearMonthDay 1997 1 1
#ASSERT `s 190 the day on which the provision comes into force` "section 95" EQUALS YearMonthDay 1997 1 1
#ASSERT `s 190 the day on which the provision comes into force` "subsection 96(5)" EQUALS YearMonthDay 1997 1 1
-- Section 7, sections 14 to 17 and Schedule I are in subsection (3) (src:3177, 3179, 3189): January 5, 1997.
#ASSERT `s 190 the day on which the provision comes into force` "section 7" EQUALS YearMonthDay 1997 1 5
#ASSERT `s 190 the day on which the provision comes into force` "section 17" EQUALS YearMonthDay 1997 1 5
#ASSERT `s 190 the day on which the provision comes into force` "Schedule I" EQUALS YearMonthDay 1997 1 5
#ASSERT `s 190 the day on which the provision comes into force` "subsection 153.1(3)" EQUALS YearMonthDay 1997 1 5
-- Sections 172 to 175 (src:3199): January 1, 1998.
#ASSERT `s 190 the day on which the provision comes into force` "section 172" EQUALS YearMonthDay 1998 1 1
#ASSERT `s 190 the day on which the provision comes into force` "section 175" EQUALS YearMonthDay 1998 1 1
-- Any other provision of the Act as enacted: June 30, 1996 (src:3171).
#ASSERT `s 190 the day on which the provision comes into force` "section 3" EQUALS YearMonthDay 1996 6 30
#ASSERT `s 190 the day on which the provision comes into force` "section 176" EQUALS YearMonthDay 1996 6 30

§ `Section 190(3.1) and (3.2) - the look-back`

-- A notice under subsection 7.1(4) issued on or after June 30, 1996 may be taken into account (src:3191).
#ASSERT `s 190(3.1) the Commission may take the notice into account in applying subsections 7.1(1) to (3)` (YearMonthDay 1996 6 30)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 190(3.1) the Commission may take the notice into account in applying subsections 7.1(1) to (3)` (YearMonthDay 1996 6 29))
-- Deductions: on and after January 5, 1997, for a period beginning on or after June 30, 1996 (src:3193).
#ASSERT `s 190(3.2) the Commission may make a deduction under subparagraph 19(3)(a)(i)` (YearMonthDay 1997 1 5) (YearMonthDay 1996 6 30)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 190(3.2) the Commission may make a deduction under subparagraph 19(3)(a)(i)` (YearMonthDay 1997 1 4) (YearMonthDay 1996 6 30))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 190(3.2) the Commission may make a deduction under subparagraph 19(3)(a)(i)` (YearMonthDay 1997 1 5) (YearMonthDay 1996 6 29))
#ASSERT `s 190(3.2) the Commission may make a deduction under subparagraph 19(3)(a)(i)` (YearMonthDay 1998 3 1) (YearMonthDay 1997 2 1)

§ `Section 190(4) and (5) - Schedule II in the interim`

-- Schedule II applies in place of section 7 from June 30, 1996 until section 7 comes into force on January 5, 1997.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 190(4) Schedule II applies in place of the provision on the day` "section 7" (YearMonthDay 1996 6 29))
#ASSERT `s 190(4) Schedule II applies in place of the provision on the day` "section 7" (YearMonthDay 1996 6 30)
#ASSERT `s 190(4) Schedule II applies in place of the provision on the day` "section 7" (YearMonthDay 1997 1 4)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 190(4) Schedule II applies in place of the provision on the day` "section 7" (YearMonthDay 1997 1 5))
-- Section 4 comes into force on January 1, 1997, so Schedule II stops applying in place of it a few days sooner.
#ASSERT `s 190(4) Schedule II applies in place of the provision on the day` "section 4" (YearMonthDay 1996 12 31)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 190(4) Schedule II applies in place of the provision on the day` "section 4" (YearMonthDay 1997 1 1))
-- A provision not listed in subsection (2) or (3) is not replaced.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 190(4) Schedule II applies in place of the provision on the day` "section 3" (YearMonthDay 1996 7 1))
-- Paragraph 6 of Schedule II continues for a benefit period beginning from June 30, 1996 to January 4, 1997 (src:3197).
#ASSERT NOT (`s 190(5) paragraph 6 of Schedule II continues to apply in place of sections 14, 16 and 17` (YearMonthDay 1996 6 29))
#ASSERT `s 190(5) paragraph 6 of Schedule II continues to apply in place of sections 14, 16 and 17` (YearMonthDay 1996 6 30)
#ASSERT `s 190(5) paragraph 6 of Schedule II continues to apply in place of sections 14, 16 and 17` (YearMonthDay 1997 1 4)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 190(5) paragraph 6 of Schedule II continues to apply in place of sections 14, 16 and 17` (YearMonthDay 1997 1 5))
